    <Label IsHitTestVisible="false" Name="Description" Style="GalleryText" Text="Every petal, leaf and the stem is a Bézier\ncurve: a smooth curve steered by a few control\npoints. Twenty-seven of them make this rose.\n\nThis is how fonts, logos and cartoon\ncharacters are drawn on computers.\n\nDrag any point and reshape the flower." DecimalsToShow="2" X="3.034" Y="1.743" />
